#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/general_instance_segmentation.rst:9
msgid "无需训练的通用实例分割模型，对输入图像/视频帧中的物体进行分割，返回边界框与分割掩码。"
msgstr ""
"A general instance segmentation model that requires no training, segments "
"objects in input images/video frames, and returns bounding boxes and "
"segmentation masks."

